    "title": "Pat Brady: Pete Hegseth will 'not survive this' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Collin McCarthy No media credit provided. ,\n4 hours ago\nPat Brady, former chairman for the Illinois Republican Party, and a former federal and state prosecutor, joins Lisa Dent to talk about the political future of Pete Hegseth as Secretary of Defense. Brady does not believe he will remain in his position following the Pentagon’s investigation into Hegseth over the Signal Chat leaks and the controversy surrounding the latest Venezuelan boat strikes .\nhttps://serve.castfire.com/audio/7841220/Pat_Brady_12_03_2025_2025-12-03-214520.64kmono.mp3 Recent Posts Lisa Dent Pat Brady: Pete Hegseth will ‘not survive this’ Ald. William Hall: Social media shares blame for violence Newsroom Story Time: 12/3/25 Organizer: Capacity limit for Christkindlmarket threatens its future NHS Chicago: Helping people become homeowners Click for more Copyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WGN Radio 720 - Chicago's Very Own.\n110",
